[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0010","text":"──Producer\n可以进来哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0020","text":"锵锵\n──怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0030","text":"哦哦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0040","text":"挺不错的嘛\n很合身哦，羽那"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0050","text":"合身……？\n……还有呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0060","text":"诶？\n那个──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0070","text":"真是的……！\n──……可爱吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0080","text":"哈哈，是我嘴笨了……！\n嗯，很可爱哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0090","text":"太好了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12700100_01_0100","text":"呵呵，被Producer夸了\n感觉就有精神了……！"}]
